{"version":1,"content":"<p>兩代小龍女李若彤和陳妍希前晚（8日）到廣州南沙出席時尚活動，1995年版的李若彤與2014年版的陳妍希驚喜同框，瞬間成為全場焦點！</p><p>陳妍希在社交平台晒出與李若彤的合照，並親切寫道：「Happy time with my 姑姑！</p><p>」相中兩人親密挽</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.381932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T16:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"68feeca068fbd3c262366136f6e304e92c4078769da99bed623941e9a1677772","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}